oundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image60.jpeg","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","title":"シーン 11","transitionName":"なし","showTelopOverlay":false,"id":"88EE7E61-1AA6-40D9-8FD4-EDFE5D26926A","telop":"そして、とりあえず、互いに入浴を済ませることにし、\n今は、こいしが先に入っているところだった。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983.011.jpeg","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"slideTitle":"第11スライド","characterName":"操夢","voiceDuration":6.956077097505669,"duration":4.6000000000000005},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_012_操夢.wav","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","animationName":"なし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.65,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image60.jpeg","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","title":"シーン 12","transitionName":"なし","showTelopOverlay":false,"id":"0968CB84-224C-4D6F-908F-860E21F17014","telop":"僕は、暇つぶしにテレビをつける。だが、なんだかどの番組をつまらなく感じ、すぐに消すと、ベッドに腰掛けぼーっとする。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983.012.jpeg","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"slideTitle":"第12スライド","characterName":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.072380952380952,"duration":5.7},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_013_操夢.wav","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","animationName":"なし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.65,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image60.jpeg","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","title":"シーン 13","transitionName":"なし","showTelopOverlay":false,"id":"F371E686-2D8D-4ABF-8790-E85708C360A2","telop":"すると、突如として部屋の電話が鳴り、受話器を取る。\n「もしもし…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983.013.jpeg","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"slideTitle":"第13スライド","characterName":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.3691156462585035,"duration":3.5},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_014_操夢.wav","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","animationName":"なし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.65,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image60.jpeg","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","title":"シーン 14","transitionName":"なし","showTelopOverlay":false,"id":"68FD275B-EF32-4AE1-B756-C19E0745060E","telop":"僕が、そう言うと、相手はこのホテルのロビーにいる従業員で、フランたちがいる屋敷から電話が来て、繋げるかを聞いてきた。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983.014.jpeg","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"slideTitle":"第14スライド","characterName":"操夢","voiceDuration":3.682154195011338,"duration":5.800000000000001},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_015_操夢.wav","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","animationName":"なし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.65,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image60.jpeg","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","title":"シーン 15","transitionName":"なし","showTelopOverlay":false,"id":"C0337182-9C7D-4E24-8718-524326FAFAFC","telop":"僕は、特に問題なく、了承すると通話相手が変わる。\nそして、聞こえてきたのは、フランの声だった。","slideImagePath":