animationName":"なし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.65,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image65.jpeg","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","title":"シーン 89","transitionName":"なし","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/アリス（困る）.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"id":"F137C26C-323C-47C2-B8F6-06DA50A78157","telop":"僕はそう言うと、バックからあるものを2つ取り出す。それは、黒色のアイマスクだった。そして、それを一つ彼女につける。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983.089.jpeg","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"slideTitle":"第89スライド","characterName":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.090861678004535,"duration":5.7},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_090_操夢.wav","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","animationName":"なし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","bgmVolume":0.65,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image65.jpeg","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AA%E3%82%B9%E3%83%BB%E3%83%9E%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AC%E3%83%88%E3%83%AD%E3%82%A4%E3%83%89","title":"シーン 90","transitionName":"なし","showTelopOverlay":false,"id":"002F0172-09CC-4FCD-B40C-A7EECD827E1F","telop":"「ちょっと、何するのよ。」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983.090.jpeg","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"slideTitle":"第90スライド","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voiceDuration":8.545850340136054,"duration":3.5},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_091_操夢.wav","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","animationName":"なし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.65,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image65.jpeg","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","title":"シーン 91","transitionName":"なし","showTelopOverlay":false,"id":"B341AAC1-120F-43F5-AF29-615A818464F8","telop":"「こういう時のために、向こうで買ったんですよ。互いにアイマスクを被れば、僕が浴室の中でアリスさんの体を支えますから…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983.091.jpeg","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"slideTitle":"第91スライド","characterName":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.915850340136054,"duration":5.9},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_092_操夢.wav","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","animationName":"なし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.65,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image65.jpeg","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","title":"シーン 92","transitionName":"なし","showTelopOverlay":false,"id":"8E49E200-55CB-4777-87AA-B36201408053","telop":"「ただ、触覚だけはどうにもならないので、そこは我慢してください。何より怪我なく、お風呂に入れるのが一番ですから。」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983.092.jpeg","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"slideTitle":"第92スライド","characterName":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.396303854875283,"duration":5.7},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_093_操夢.wav","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","animationName":"なし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.65,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image65.jpeg","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","title":"シーン 93","transitionName":"なし","showTelopOverlay":false,"id":"B4F59E56-E904-41DF-AB4E-1DF755CE7AEF","telop":"僕はそう言いながら、アイマスクを被る。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983.093.jpeg","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"slideTitle":"第93スライド","characterName":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.7995464852607705,"duration":3.5},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_094_操夢.wav","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","animationName":"なし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.65,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image65.jpeg","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","title":"シーン 94","transitionName":"なし","showTelopOverlay":false,"id":"1F975E77-3882-4E42-8CB4-9BE1E0B945DC","telop":"僕は、暗闇の中、スッと息を吸い、神経を透き済ますと、触覚だけを頼り、彼女の服を脱がせ、自分自身も服を脱ぐ。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983.094.jpeg","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"slideTitle":"第94スライド","characterName":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.436507936507937,"duration":5.300000000000001},{"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_095_操夢.wav","backgroundName":"image65.jpeg","animationName":"なし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmVolume":0.65,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image65.jpeg","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","title":"シーン 95","transitionName":"なし","showTelopOverlay":false,"id":"109AE1E1-EF30-4142-B1F5-41FB145FB682","telop":"そして、彼女をそっと抱え上げると、浴室の段差に気をつけながら、中に入っていき、そのまま彼女の入浴を補助するのだった。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983.095.jpeg","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"slideTitle":"第95スライド","characterName":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.523469387755101,"duration":5.800000000000001},{"backgroundName":"単色背景","animationName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","bgmVolume":0.65,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","title":"ご視聴ありがとうございました！","showTelopOverlay":false,"id":"060C3517-F2AC-43B3-84C6-4EE7D77E9324","telop":"","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983\/元女子校の日常　第21話_5cc8f81983.096.jpeg","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"slideTitle":"中扉","characterName":"","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":20}]